<title>HUNGARY: Hungary two-yr govt bond yield falls to 23.10 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary two-yr govt bond yield falls to 23.10 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on the latest issue of Hungary's two-year government bonds was set by auction at 23.10 percent, down from 23.34 percent at auction two weeks ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said on Thursday  HTBK.		 1998/K BOND</p>
<p>    Total on offer	    12,500 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received     48,681.20 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	   12,500 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		13,125 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    23.10 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     99.358pct</p>
</text>
